      "description": "Watch San Jose Earthquakes vs LA Galaxy highlights and goals from Major League Soccer on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 26, 2026. The competitive spirit of the Major League Soccer was on full display in this high-stakes encounter between the San Jose Earthquakes and the LA Galaxy . As both teams fought for dominance, the match evolved into a gripping tactical battle that kept the outcome uncertain until the final whistle. Early Momentum On July 26, 2026 , the match commenced with both sides showing immediate intent. It was the LA Galaxy who broke the deadlock in the 13th minute, with Joseph Paintsil firing home following a clever assist from Marco Reus . The goal injected urgency into the San Jose Earthquakes , leading to a fractious period marked by yellow cards for Lucas Sanabria and Julian Aude as both teams battled for control before halftime. The Fightback and Late Heartbreak After the interval, the home side emerged with renewed purpose. In the 63rd minute, Reid Roberts leveled the score thanks to a decisive pass from Daniel Munie , swinging the momentum in favor of the hosts. The intensity boiled over in the closing stages, leading to a dramatic penalty opportunity in the 95th minute. Timo Werner stepped up to take the spot-kick but ultimately missed the target, denying his team a late winner. A flurry of late bookings for Benjamin Kikanovic and Joseph Paintsil summarized the fiery nature of the closing minutes as the referee finally brought the action to a close."
